<header class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="venue">Accepted at NeSy 2026</span>
    <h1>Symmetry-Aware Foundation Model <br>for Logic Rule Induction</h1>
    <p class="authors"><a href="/">Yin Jun Phua</a></p>
    <a class="affil" href="https://www.isct.ac.jp/en" aria-label="Institute of Science Tokyo">
      <img src="/papers/nri/assets/isct-lockup.png" alt="Institute of Science Tokyo">
    </a>
